  items now a Hash keyed by SKU            pass 0/5  squished 5/5  avg 1.7s  wrong: total_dollarsx5 placed_onx5
  whole order as one CSV line              pass 0/5  squished 5/5  avg 1.7s  wrong: total_dollarsx5 item_countx5 placed_onx5
  prices missing (cannot be totaled)       pass 0/5  squished 5/5  avg 1.6s  
  TOTAL                                    pass 5/50

